Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.27,0:00:03.23,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"London"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.23,0:00:07.48,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"DEM Industries Headquarters"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.69,0:00:07.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell were you \Nthinking, Mr. Westcott?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.86,0:00:11.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't understand what\Nyou're asking, Murdoch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.24,0:00:12.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wish you'd stop playing dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.20,0:00:16.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm asking about all the\Nthings you did in Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.95,0:00:19.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Interfering with the Self-Defense Force...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.03,0:00:21.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Using Wizards and equipment\Nfor your own agenda, and worse...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.83,0:00:24.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Making the city a warzone!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.46,0:00:27.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Japanese government is all over us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.46,0:00:29.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How will you rectify this situation?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.05,0:00:31.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's no matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.42,0:00:34.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We achieved enough to make it worthwhile.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.17,0:00:37.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We succeeded in Princess's inversion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.39,0:00:39.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you not understand what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.64,0:00:43.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do Spirits have to do with saving DEM?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.06,0:00:46.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The company can't afford to take\Na backseat to your selfish desires!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.60,0:00:50.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone, the time has come!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.02,0:00:53.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I petition that Managing Director\NWestcott be dismissed!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.61,0:00:56.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And you're fine with this, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.91,0:00:58.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.03,0:01:01.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,After all, doing so is a right\Nof the board of directors.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.04,0:01:03.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Come, Chairman Russell!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.75,0:01:05.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let us take a vote this instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.83,0:01:09.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Very well. A raise of hands to dismiss him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.55,0:01:14.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Zero hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.67,0:01:16.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,His dismissal is rejected.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.55,0:01:18.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What are you talking about, Chairman?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.93,0:01:20.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All these people agree with--
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.89,0:01:28.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll find Realizers ready in the infirmary.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.94,0:01:32.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you get there quickly, you'll be\Nback to normal in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.11,0:01:38.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And once I fulfill those selfish\Ndesires you spoke of,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.36,0:01:40.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll hand over the company.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.45,0:01:41.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It won't be long now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.41,0:01:45.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Not when compared to how\Nlong we've been waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.09,0:01:52.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A written challenge...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.84,0:01:55.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And with it, 12 pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.51,0:01:56.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She asks this...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.30,0:01:59.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can you find me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.93,0:03:31.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So, these must be the\Npictures that Natsumi sent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.27,0:03:35.69,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Episode Two:\N'Can You Find Me?'"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.64,0:03:33.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"Among them, I'm there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.81,0:03:36.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can you guess who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.07,0:03:37.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Before everyone is gone."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.57,0:03:40.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That was Natsumi's message.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.03,0:03:42.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If we take it at face value...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.99,0:03:45.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi is impersonating one of these 12,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.16,0:03:48.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and if you can't find her,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.37,0:03:51.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,they will disappear one\Nafter another, or so it seems.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.30,0:03:53.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Most likely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.75,0:03:58.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Though, she makes no mention of\Na time limit or methods you can't take.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.71,0:04:01.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't imagine she simply\Nforgot to write that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.68,0:04:04.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,While you're puzzled and overwhelmed,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.93,0:04:07.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,she's probably overseeing\Nthe game from somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.31,0:04:11.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No... It may not be safe to call this a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.02,0:04:14.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Those erased by Natsumi...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.31,0:04:16.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...we can't guarantee will come back safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.48,0:04:21.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's true. Taking Kurumi, for example...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.44,0:04:25.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi may not be so friendly\Nas to horse around and play games.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.82,0:04:29.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Someone here may already\Nbe gone for eternity...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.37,0:04:30.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.41,0:04:32.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi isn't like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.54,0:04:34.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I can just guess who she's impersonating,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.96,0:04:36.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,they'll come home in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.42,0:04:40.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're sure giving Natsumi your full trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.80,0:04:41.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If it were you,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.84,0:04:45.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,would you open up your heart\Nto someone who doesn't trust you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.47,0:04:49.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look at you, talking so big...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.89,0:04:52.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Though, it's exactly like you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.68,0:04:53.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.93,0:04:55.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Either way, we should hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.48,0:04:59.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, Kotori, but stay\Naway from command.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.27,0:05:01.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's only natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.86,0:05:04.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's still the possibility \Nthat I'm Natsumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.90,0:05:07.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And you, Shin...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.17,0:05:09.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You have lots of work ahead of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.41,0:05:11.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.54,0:05:13.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For the time being,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.75,0:05:17.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,start by deciding which\Norder you'll date them in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.34,0:05:23.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,To see through Natsumi's disguise,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.51,0:05:26.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,you must not overlook even the\Nsmallest difference from the norm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.80,0:05:31.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll date them one by one\Nto check if anything seems off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.60,0:05:36.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I feel like it's wrong to go\Non dates while doubting people...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.31,0:05:38.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.69,0:05:42.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry! Did you wait long?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.73,0:05:44.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Nope. You're right on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.24,0:05:53.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's Tohka no matter how you look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.54,0:05:57.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong, Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.46,0:05:59.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't seem very lively today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.96,0:06:02.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh? Y-You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.17,0:06:03.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm normal, normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.88,0:06:05.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Try to relax, Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.84,0:06:07.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even supposing she's Natsumi,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.68,0:06:09.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,she wouldn't give it away so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.76,0:06:12.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's try to shake her up a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.77,0:06:16.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Tohka.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.14,0:06:20.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Remember the last time\Nwe went out? When was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.85,0:06:23.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.02,0:06:26.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Weren't we shopping together\Njust a few days ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.24,0:06:28.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, oh, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.15,0:06:29.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She got it. Next is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.49,0:06:33.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I don't mind going out\Nno matter how much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.83,0:06:36.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Because it's fun and makes me happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.00,0:06:38.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tohka...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.04,0:06:43.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmph... What a performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.54,0:06:44.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.59,0:06:46.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're just like Tohka.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.17,0:06:47.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right, Natsumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.30,0:06:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.34,0:06:52.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.22,0:06:54.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido! Who's this Natsumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.60,0:06:55.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.35,0:06:58.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm asking you who this woman\Nyou named just now is!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.73,0:07:01.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where's this woman of yours, Shido?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.35,0:07:03.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, that was...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.15,0:07:05.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A-A greeting! A greeting!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.32,0:07:08.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,From an island down south!\NIt caught on in Japan, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.99,0:07:11.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Natsumi! Natsumi! You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.41,0:07:12.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.24,0:07:15.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What an incredible lie...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.03,0:07:17.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's so bad, it could be real...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.79,0:07:20.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see! So it's just a greeting!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.46,0:07:23.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So when people say "Natsumi,"\Nwhat does it mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.79,0:07:25.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.13,0:07:28.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"Th-That I love you," I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.46,0:07:30.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.93,0:07:35.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And? What did you mean by\N"You're just like Tohka"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.22,0:07:35.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.97,0:07:36.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.81,0:07:38.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Wow! Look, Tohka! That restaurant\Nis doing a lunch buffet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.68,0:07:40.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--Huh?\N--Wow! Look, Tohka! That restaurant\Nis doing a lunch buffet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.89,0:07:42.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It'd be a waste if we didn't eat there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.60,0:07:46.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Lunch, huh? I don't mind, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.77,0:07:48.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right! Let's go then!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.69,0:07:52.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's lunch, and yet... What's this reaction?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.16,0:07:56.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Normally, that'd be enough\Nto cheer her up instantly...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.29,0:08:02.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,As of yet, no detection of Natsumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.75,0:08:04.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Have you felt anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.08,0:08:07.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm thinking it's gotta be Tohka...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.54,0:08:10.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But we're here for lunch, and she seems so...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.67,0:08:14.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.51,0:08:16.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Something the matter, Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.73,0:08:17.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.43,0:08:21.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No way! Tohka only got that much?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.06,0:08:23.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you think she's sick or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.06,0:08:26.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Absurd! That hungry monster\Nis a bottomless pit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.56,0:08:28.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey... Aren't you eating?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.77,0:08:30.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's eat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.15,0:08:32.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,R-Right... Let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.16,0:08:37.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't think... Tohka is really Natsumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.49,0:08:39.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for the meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.79,0:08:41.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh? Already?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.96,0:08:44.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong, Tohka?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.62,0:08:46.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That can't possibly be enough for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.52,0:08:48.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I-It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.75,0:08:50.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I saw on TV yesterday...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.96,0:08:52.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.26,0:08:54.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Girls who eat lots more than guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.38,0:08:56.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...can sometimes be a turn off!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.35,0:09:02.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't want Shido to be turned off by me...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.06,0:09:03.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.68,0:09:08.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, I prefer girls who\Ncan happily eat lots of food.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.31,0:09:10.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.11,0:09:14.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I knew it had to be Tohka after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.70,0:09:17.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah... But we can't dismiss her yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.32,0:09:23.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stay with Tohka a bit longer,\Nbut get back home by at least 3 o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.33,0:09:26.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your next date will come to visit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.87,0:09:27.88,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,"Out of food for today"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.34,0:09:33.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.88,0:09:34.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Boo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.97,0:09:41.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Be a little more careful, Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.39,0:09:42.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Th-Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.89,0:09:44.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait... Yoshinon, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.14,0:09:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hi! It's everyone's idol, Yoshinon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.19,0:09:51.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Yoshino.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.98,0:09:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yoshinon surprised me, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.45,0:10:00.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,T-Trick or treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.82,0:10:04.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't give candy, \NI have to prank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.13,0:10:15.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido, this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.26,0:10:18.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Never thought you'd come\Nhere trick or treating.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.01,0:10:19.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're kinda out of candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.18,0:10:22.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hope you're not offended by hotcakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.89,0:10:26.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is a first for me... hotcakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.77,0:10:29.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see... Well, help yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.58,0:10:47.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You had the same reaction\Nthe first time you came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.41,0:10:49.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.00,0:10:52.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What was it you ate back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.13,0:10:54.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That was...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.01,0:11:01.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You made {\i1}oyakodon{\i0} for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.47,0:11:03.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.05,0:11:05.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh? What's this about, Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.47,0:11:07.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That doesn't ring a bell to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.81,0:11:09.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.52,0:11:10.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.60,0:11:15.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Could it be... Was that when\NI stayed over at Origami's?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.36,0:11:17.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yeah, that happened...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.90,0:11:21.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I had to invade Origami's\Nplace to get you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.70,0:11:24.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.33,0:11:25.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,C'mon, just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.87,0:11:28.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.45,0:11:29.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We can split it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.21,0:11:31.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh? No, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.92,0:11:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I made those for you, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.17,0:11:38.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A-All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.55,0:11:39.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.01,0:11:42.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.68,0:11:45.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A-Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.31,0:11:47.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Was it yummy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.72,0:11:49.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yup! Very yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.93,0:11:51.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.94,0:11:53.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido, there's syrup...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.23,0:11:55.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm? On me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.74,0:12:02.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.11,0:12:06.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hotcakes are like, halfway\Nbetween food and candy, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.04,0:12:10.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.00,0:12:11.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It was a prank!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.21,0:12:16.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whew, whew! You go girl, Yoshino!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.00,0:12:17.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Reine...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.17,0:12:20.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You think... that was \Nthe real Yoshino, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.59,0:12:22.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.88,0:12:25.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So? Who's my next date?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.39,0:12:27.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Right. Hiroto Tonomachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.10,0:12:35.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tohka, Yoshino, and third, \NHiroto Tonomachi...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.02,0:12:40.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,None of their behavior or memories\Nseemed much different than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.28,0:12:45.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That whole thing with Tonomachi\NI'd prefer to not call a date...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.61,0:12:47.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shin, just one more for the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.45,0:12:51.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yuzuru is already waiting at the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.83,0:12:52.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.46,0:12:55.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Yuzuru!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.00,0:12:57.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Offended.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.17,0:13:01.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You have some nerve calling\Nme here and arriving late.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.17,0:13:03.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry! Was running a bit late!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.93,0:13:07.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pardon. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.39,0:13:09.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I have a big heart, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.43,0:13:11.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll call those five minutes a fluke.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.86,0:13:21.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Does it not seem enough with only me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.28,0:13:23.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Eh? N-No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.03,0:13:26.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I was just thinking how rare it is...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.20,0:13:31.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Negative. Don't feel as if\Nyou need to make an excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.74,0:13:34.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kaguya and I are of one heart and mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.87,0:13:36.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In fact, your statement...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.92,0:13:40.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It validates how closely she\Nand I are bound together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.17,0:13:45.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Question.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.76,0:13:49.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,By the way, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.01,0:13:50.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Calling me out this late...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.93,0:13:52.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.14,0:13:55.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thought it'd be nice to talk\Nwith you alone once in a while...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.35,0:13:57.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Bad idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.40,0:14:01.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Negative. It's not a bad idea at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.02,0:14:02.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But if it's like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.03,0:14:07.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yuzuru?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.82,0:14:12.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Selfish. Just for tonight, Shido is all mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.74,0:14:13.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.04,0:14:17.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Suggestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.29,0:14:19.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido, shall we take a walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.34,0:14:26.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.01,0:14:30.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Admiration. It's so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.14,0:14:32.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.98,0:14:39.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Point. If a girl says something is beautiful,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.65,0:14:44.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,it's common knowledge the guy\Nshould say "But you're more beautiful."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.23,0:14:46.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is that how it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.99,0:14:49.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Agreement. That's how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.03,0:14:52.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But you're more beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.83,0:14:57.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Smile. Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.54,0:14:58.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.83,0:15:00.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Address.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.67,0:15:02.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.96,0:15:04.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.38,0:15:07.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Question.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.63,0:15:12.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido... Between Kaguya and me,\Nwho do you like more?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.60,0:15:16.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't pick when you ask so suddenly...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.56,0:15:18.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're both precious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.98,0:15:21.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Scorn. Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.98,0:15:25.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You picked the most pathetic\Nand weak answer there was.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.48,0:15:28.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sh-Shut up. When you\Nask that, all of a sudden...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.40,0:15:30.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Confirmation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.57,0:15:35.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then, if I gave you enough time,\Nwould you be able to answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.25,0:15:44.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In that case, what answer\Ndid you wanna hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.00,0:15:45.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.50,0:15:51.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Had you picked Kaguya,\NI would've called you a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.13,0:15:53.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But if you had picked me... Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.35,0:15:56.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I learned something new...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.31,0:15:58.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Addition.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.52,0:16:01.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But, if you had picked me...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.60,0:16:03.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...I'd be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.44,0:16:09.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then, which is it in the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.82,0:16:12.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sigh. It's just like I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.99,0:16:15.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wouldn't mind you choosing either of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.91,0:16:18.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,However, you answered like a chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.33,0:16:21.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You disappoint me, Shido, you big buffoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.33,0:16:22.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ugh...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.33,0:16:24.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Though...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.63,0:16:26.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Petition.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.04,0:16:29.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If... Just if...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.96,0:16:34.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If Kaguya ever asks you\Nthe same question I did...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.43,0:16:38.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When the time comes,\Ntell her that you choose Kaguya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.85,0:16:43.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Prediction. Kaguya will get mad at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.10,0:16:45.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She'll ask why you didn't pick me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.81,0:16:49.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But, deep inside she'll be so happy it hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.65,0:16:50.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yuzuru...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.32,0:16:52.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.65,0:16:56.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kaguya behaves like she does,\Nbut she loves you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.37,0:16:59.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's me saying it, so it must be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.49,0:17:03.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The things that Kaguya hates, I also hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.62,0:17:06.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Likewise, the things that I love...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.42,0:17:08.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...Kaguya also loves, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.21,0:17:14.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Careless. I said more than I should have.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.59,0:17:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Before I say anything more, I should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.43,0:17:19.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yuzuru...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.01,0:17:22.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Petition. What I said is no lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.93,0:17:26.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kaguya is extremely taken with you, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.98,0:17:29.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Please take care of Kaguya for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.15,0:17:33.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hey, Yuzuru! Yuzuru!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.87,0:17:42.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And? You came home after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.08,0:17:47.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,After a date, making a girl walk\Nhome at night all by herself...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.17,0:17:50.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...is not exactly a choice\NI'm impressed with.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.34,0:17:53.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry. It happened so fast...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.17,0:17:54.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's not much you could've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.42,0:17:58.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,From start to finish,\NShin worked hard today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.68,0:18:00.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know that full well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.64,0:18:04.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Going on four dates in a single day\Nisn't such an easy schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.39,0:18:06.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So? Your thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.02,0:18:10.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tohka, Yoshino, Tonomachi, Yuzuru...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.27,0:18:13.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,From your perspective,\Nwas Natsumi impersonating anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.98,0:18:15.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.74,0:18:17.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't say for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.61,0:18:20.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I want to believe everyone was real, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.37,0:18:23.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it's wishful thinking\Nthat it would be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.95,0:18:28.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There's no suspicious readings\Nfrom Fraxinus' analysis either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.79,0:18:31.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Until we get more data from\Nthe next round of dates,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.42,0:18:33.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,it's anyone's guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.09,0:18:37.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Anyways, go and get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.34,0:18:39.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't want you to be sleep deprived.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.39,0:18:44.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you screw up your dates tomorrow,\Nit'll trouble everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.56,0:18:45.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.93,0:18:48.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Reine, tomorrow starts at 10, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.81,0:18:49.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.94,0:18:52.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your first date... is Kotori.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.11,0:18:54.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see, that's why--
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.40,0:18:56.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Y-You're so wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.19,0:18:58.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I just, as the commander...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.36,0:19:01.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you spaced out for?\NGo to bed already!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.66,0:19:07.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Return. I have come home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.54,0:19:08.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yuzuru!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.54,0:19:11.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What was your urgent business?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.54,0:19:15.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Trivial. It was nothing too important.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.68,0:19:29.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's time...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.44,0:19:31.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Haniel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.02,0:19:36.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,First, one person...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.78,0:19:38.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can you actually guess who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.99,0:19:40.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Before everyone is gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.37,0:19:53.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's the deal, this \Nearly in the morning...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.79,0:19:55.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.75,0:19:57.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,K-Kaguya?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.76,0:19:58.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She's gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.96,0:20:02.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When I woke up, Yuzuru was gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.35,0:20:13.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How's Kaguya?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.94,0:20:15.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Calmer than this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.98,0:20:19.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,To be safe, I'm having Tohka\Nand Yoshino stay with her,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.28,0:20:21.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,so I think she's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.49,0:20:29.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yuzuru was taken to Ratatoskr HQ\Nfor an urgent exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.20,0:20:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Or so we'll say...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.16,0:20:34.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Though if Kaguya is Natsumi disguised,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.71,0:20:37.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,it's a completely pointless lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.80,0:20:39.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So, Reine?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.55,0:20:40.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who did take Yuzuru?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.55,0:20:43.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Was it Natsumi after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.88,0:20:46.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, look at this...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.76,0:20:47.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.35,0:20:50.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A video from an autonomous camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.72,0:20:55.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The 12 people Natsumi identified\Nare being watched around the clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.81,0:20:58.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This is from midnight last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.90,0:21:01.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,At this point, it looks normal to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.61,0:21:02.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.74,0:21:07.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's Natsumi's...!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.74,0:21:11.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yuzuru!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.29,0:21:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,As you can see...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.96,0:21:18.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yuzuru was taken by Natsumi's Angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.75,0:21:23.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's likely that the real person\NNatsumi is impersonating...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.13,0:21:24.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...was also erased like so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.51,0:21:27.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tsk... Natsumi...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.76,0:21:29.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why would you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.35,0:21:32.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Finding out her intentions can wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.89,0:21:36.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We must focus to ensure\Nthere's no more victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.60,0:21:38.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I believe in Natsumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.56,0:21:40.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That this is just a game...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.90,0:21:43.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Which is why I'm putting an end to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.32,0:21:46.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Before anyone else disappears...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.16,0:21:48.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right, Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.24,0:21:51.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's not spare any effort.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.83,0:21:54.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's about time that we begin our date.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.21,0:21:57.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,However, in the days that come after...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.25,0:22:01.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm made to know how powerless I really am.
